#: ../../source/users/schema/multiple_paste.rst:5
msgid "Multiple paste"
msgstr "多个粘贴"

#: ../../source/users/schema/multiple_paste.rst:7
msgid ""
"For making the schema creation more efficient, QElectroTech provides the "
"feature multiple paste. This feature allows `copying`_ and `pasting`_ one or"
" more objects automating some object definition actions."
msgstr ""
"QElectroTech 提供了特性多粘贴，用于提高计划创建的效率。 这个特性允许 `复制 <copying_>`_ 和 `pasting "
"<pasting_>`_ 一个或多个对象将一些对象定义动作自动化 。"

#: ../../source/users/schema/multiple_paste.rst:13
msgid "Figure: QElectroTech multiple paste"
msgstr "图：QElectroTech 多面贴"

#: ../../source/users/schema/multiple_paste.rst:15
msgid ""
"As a difference to the standard `copy`_ and `paste`_ feature, the multiple "
"paste feature provides the following options:"
msgstr "作为与标准 `复制 <copy_>`_ 和 `粘贴 <paste_>`_ 特性的区别，多粘贴特性提供了以下选项："

#: ../../source/users/schema/multiple_paste.rst:18
msgid ""
"`Copy`_ and `paste`_ an object (`element`_, `conductor`_, `text field`_, "
"etc.) multiple times in one action."
msgstr ""
"`复制 <Copy_>`_ 和 `粘贴 <paste_>`_ 一个对象 `元件 <element_>`_，`导体 "
"<conductor_>`_，`文本字段 <text field_>`_ 等在一个动作中多次。"

#: ../../source/users/schema/multiple_paste.rst:19
msgid ""
"Use QElectroTech auto-connection feature for `element terminals`_ which are "
"at the same horizontal or vertical line."
msgstr "使用QElectroTech自动连接功能，用于水平线或垂直线相同的 `元素终端 <element terminals_>`_。"

#: ../../source/users/schema/multiple_paste.rst:20
msgid ""
"Self-numbering of the copied `element/s`_, the `standard copy`_ feature does"
" not allow using auto-numbering patterns."
msgstr ""
"自编号复制的 `element/s <element/s_>`_，`标准复制 <standard copy_>`_ 特性不允许使用自动编号模式。"

#: ../../source/users/schema/multiple_paste.rst:21
msgid ""
"Self-numbering of the copied/created `conductor/s`_, the `standard copy`_ "
"feature does not allow using auto-numbering patterns."
msgstr ""
"自编号复制/创建的 `导体/s <conductor/s_>`_，`标准复制 <standard copy_>`_ 特性不允许使用自动编号模式。"

#: ../../source/users/schema/multiple_paste.rst:23
msgid "To copy and paste multiple times one or more object:"
msgstr "要复制和粘贴多次一个或多个对象："

#: ../../source/users/schema/multiple_paste.rst:25
msgid "`Select the object/s`_ which should be copied."
msgstr "`选择应当复制的对象/s <Select the object/s_>`_。"

#: ../../source/users/schema/multiple_paste.rst:26
msgid "Right click on the selected object/s."
msgstr "右键单击选定的对象/s。"

#: ../../source/users/schema/multiple_paste.rst:31
msgid "Figure: QElectroTech element right click PopUP window"
msgstr "图：QElectroTech 元素右键点击 PopUP 窗口"

#: ../../source/users/schema/multiple_paste.rst:33
msgid ""
"Select the option **Multiple paste** to display the multiple paste PopUP "
"window."
msgstr "选择选项 **多面贴** 以显示多面贴 PopUP 窗口 。"

#: ../../source/users/schema/multiple_paste.rst:38
msgid "Figure: QElectroTech multiple paste PopUP window"
msgstr "图：QElectroTech 多重粘贴 PopUP 窗口"

#: ../../source/users/schema/multiple_paste.rst:40
msgid "Define the ``X`` and ``Y`` offset between original and copy/copies."
msgstr "定义 ``X`` 和 ``Y`` 在原件和副本/副本之间相冲。"

#: ../../source/users/schema/multiple_paste.rst:41
msgid "Define the number of copies desired."
msgstr "定义想要的拷贝数量。"

#: ../../source/users/schema/multiple_paste.rst:42
msgid ""
"Click the desired options about `auto-connection`_, `self-numbering of "
"elements`_ and `self-numbering of conductors`_."
msgstr ""
"点击所希望的关于 `自动连接 <auto-connection_>`_，`元素的自编号 <self-numbering of elements_>`_ "
"和 `导体的自编号 <self-numbering of conductors_>`_ 选项。"

#: ../../source/users/schema/multiple_paste.rst:43
msgid ""
"Press **OK** Button to close the multiple paste PopUP window and create the "
"copies."
msgstr "按 **OK** 按钮关闭多个粘贴 PopUP 窗口并创建副本。"
